# Patch 0956 (wish of DevJunior, 26.11.2026: "the Remake's weapon animations", the handguns after their reload). Not a
# bug of the prototype: a port feature of the mods.
# wep/pl_handgun.cpp wep02_r3_set00, wep02_r3_fire00 and the return from the reload: Leon's (pl_type 0) aim idle
# (PL_ARC 0x26..0x28) and fire (0x29..0x2B) through runtime/locomotion.cpp re4_move_hg_pose: the remake's (move.dat
# 0xB8.. / 0xC0..: its legs and torso with the game's arms, aim and fire alike so that the body does not jump between
# them) when the game's motion is as long as the one made for its weapon; any other length, character, weapon or the
# movements off: the game's.
